## When to use an error summary

When a user makes a mistake, you must show an error summary at the top of the page as well as an [error message](https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/components/error-message) next to each answer that contains an error.

Always show an error summary when there is a validation error, even if there's only 1 mistake.

